      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate pain management and clinical guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr Johnson and her veterinary assistants for their deep empathy, patience, and thorough clinical explanations. Reviewers highlight how team members take time to understand complex chronic pain histories in senior animals. Clients describe feeling supported throughout mobility rehabilitation programmes, noting a welcoming atmosphere where staff treat pets like family."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 31,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and patient animal handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the tender, low-stress handling provided to sensitive and injured dogs during physical evaluations and treatments. Clinicians and veterinary nurses are praised for sitting on the floor with timid pets, offering treats, and adapting techniques to each animal's comfort level. Owners note that fearful animals quickly feel relaxed in the hospital."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Restored pet mobility and pain relief"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Families report noticeable improvements in mobility, comfort, and vitality for older dogs suffering from arthritis and musculoskeletal conditions. Multiple reviews mention successful outcomes with tailored rehabilitation, laser therapy, and targeted pain relief regimens. Pet owners appreciate clear treatment protocols that provide older companion animals with enhanced quality of life."
      }
    }
  ],
